OL,3,GNEWSAMore road closures for race
OL,4,Aqualifying sessions
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads on the Isle of Man are set to
OL,7,Fclose twice on Wednesday for qualifying
OL,8,Fin the Manx Grand Prix and Classic TT.
OL,10,FOrganisers have confirmed that a
OL,11,Fdaytime contingency session will be
OL,12,Fused to make up for the cancellation of
OL,13,FMonday's evening session due to rain.
OL,15,FIt follows disruption to the second
OL,16,Fhalf of Sunday's opening session due to
OL,17,Fa red flag incident and incoming
OL,18,Fshowers.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
