OL,3,GNEWSAMore road closures for race
OL,4,Aqualifying sessions
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough there had been doubt over
OL,7,FTuesday evening's qualifying, clerk of
OL,8,Fthe course Gary Thompson said the
OL,9,Flatest weather forecast indicated
OL,10,Fconditions would be "suitable", however
OL,11,Fhe warned of "a chance" of rain
OL,12,Fdisruption" later in the evening.
